I think you're ready for the castle but write yourself magic missle first. 
You should be able to get the drawbridge open and kill just about everything 
from afar with magic missile.  Once inside, bless/fix your armor to maximum 
by writing scrolls.  -35 is fine.  Then proceed down to the Valley and get 
the robe, your last piece of required armor.

At this point I would drop some of the clutter like multiple wands of 
whatever (striking, cold, fire, etc.  Keep a cold wand around to freeze 
moats but ditch the rest except for cancellation, digging - you can never 
have too many, any polymorph).

Drop the crystal ball and pick-axe, they weigh a lot.  Bless your unicorn 
horn and keep a backup in your bag if you have the weight allowance.

After all this concentrate on getting your HP's to at least 350.

This looks like a promising character, good luck!

